From 0048902e80ee1c81a703bbe68c5ed3d35d31e9f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZonicExists <71136987+zonicisalive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 01:31:52 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 27/38] bitproxy: call the app BitProxy everywhere; source
 link, no sponsor

- VPN session name (shown by Android) and the notification title
  fallback use the app name instead of 'sing-box'.
- Four UI strings that named the app 'sing-box' are overridden in all
  five languages from new resource files in the 'other' flavor, so the
  upstream strings.xml files stay untouched.
- About: 'Source Code' points to the BitProxy repository (GPLv3 requires
  offering this modified version's source); 'Sponsor' is removed.
sing-box is still named where it means the core engine (core version)
and in the internal sing-box:// link scheme.
---
